{"parse": {"title": "茸茸特供罐", "pageid": 118688, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"茸茸特供罐\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/a5/CurrencyItem-3103.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"茸茸特供罐\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>茸茸特供罐</b><img alt=\"CurrencyIcon-3103 1.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/CurrencyIcon-3103_1.png/24px-CurrencyIcon-3103_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/CurrencyIcon-3103_1.png/36px-CurrencyIcon-3103_1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/CurrencyIcon-3103_1.png/48px-CurrencyIcon-3103_1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>2#3103</div></div><hr /><div>一盒足以称得上诱饵的零食罐，内有微尘、脆树枝与仙境气泡，在井中冒险后的最佳酬劳。用于鼓励魔精员工在好梦井完成一次打捞。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">漫步于荒原的人们皆对“井”有所好奇。泉水精灵向其注入清水，仙境所爱的少女则赠它以糖浆，而它以变幻的色彩作出回答。最终，能在“井”中徜徉的是那些毛茸茸的小家伙，它们跃入其中，带着“井”的馈赠回归，就像狗儿身上沾满苍耳。你只需奉上佳肴，作为小小冒险之后的美餐。</div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "物品"}], "displaytitle": "茸茸特供罐"}}